BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:98f103fe-2b03-4c1e-9dab-eda2aa4e6239@serenityfinancialco
DTSTAMP:20260908T142200Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260916
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260917
SUMMARY:SFC Campaign: Countdown to Tax Season
DESCRIPTION:Lane: Campaign / Awareness\nFormat: Branded graphic\nGoal: Build anticipation + early tax-season awareness\n\nCaption:\nTax season might feel far away right now\, but January has a funny way of pulling up FAST. 😭💼\n\nSo we’re getting ahead of it this year.\n\nNow is a good time to start:\n✔️ gathering important documents\n✔️ organizing income records\n✔️ keeping up with business expenses\n✔️ writing down questions you want answered before filing\n\nYou don’t have to know everything right now.\n\nYou just don’t want January to arrive and have you digging through emails\, drawers\, screenshots and the glove compartment looking for paperwork. 😂\n\nSerenity Financial Co. is getting ready for the 2027 tax season\, and I’m taking y’all along with me.\n\n📍 DFW + Virtual throughout Texas\n@serenityfinancialco\n\nLess stress. More clarity.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b484fd2c-5d0f-498f-ae84-bb5fa3ea394c@serenityfinancialco
DTSTAMP:20260908T142200Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260918
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260919
SUMMARY:SFC LegalShield: Need extra peace of mind?
DESCRIPTION:Lane: LegalShield / Resource Awareness\nFormat: Branded graphic + talking Story\nGoal: Introduce LegalShield softly\n\nCaption:\nOne thing I’m big on is having somewhere to turn when you have a question and don’t even know where to start.\n\nBecause sometimes the problem isn’t taxes.\n\nSometimes it’s a contract.\nA letter you received.\nAn identity-related concern.\nA small-business question.\nOr one of those situations where you’re sitting there thinking…\n\n“Do I need to talk to somebody about this?” 😭\n\nThat’s why I also offer LegalShield as an optional resource alongside Serenity Financial Co.\n\nIt gives individuals\, families\, and business owners another place to turn when legal questions come up.\n\nYou don’t have to already be in a crisis to want peace of mind.\n\nIf you’ve been curious about LegalShield or want to know how the memberships work\, send me “LEGAL” and I’ll send you the information. ⚖️💛\n\n@serenityfinancialco\n\nLess stress. More clarity.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
