BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d9383e3b-bed1-4b06-92f9-defd997d9e99@serenityfinancialco
DTSTAMP:20260908T142200Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260926
SUMMARY:SFC Conversion: Haven’t filed yet?
DESCRIPTION:Lane: Conversion / Service Promo\nFormat: Branded graphic\nGoal: Reach people behind on filing\n\nCaption:\nIf you haven’t filed a previous tax return yet\, please don’t let embarrassment keep you avoiding it. 💛\n\nLife happens.\n\nPaperwork gets lost.\nYears get away from us.\nSometimes you just don’t know where to start.\n\nThat doesn’t mean you have to keep putting it off.\n\nIf you have prior-year returns that still need attention\, Serenity Financial Co. can help you get organized\, figure out what documents you need\, and work through the next steps.\n\nNo judgment. No making you feel crazy for asking questions.\n\nJust clarity and a plan. 💼\n\nIf this sounds like you\, send me a message and let’s talk about what you still need to file.\n\n📍 DFW + Virtual throughout Texas\n@serenityfinancialco\n\nLess stress. More clarity.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
